# ── build artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing below is authored. Every one of them is regenerated by `npm run build`
# (or by the dev server), which means every one of them changes on a round's gate
# run and gets swept into the round's `git add -- <game>` — where scripts/vts-round.mjs
# refuses the commit as build output and a finished, gated-green round becomes
# unlandable. Patterns here; the untracking was the commit that added them.
node_modules/
*.tsbuildinfo
5_gamejam_1/dist/
4_chunbai/new_game/dist/

# ── sprite-generation scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 7_hotlineShanghai's intro sprites are generated by prompt->PNG runs whose every
# candidate lands here (97 files, 95 MB of 8_E.png / composite.png / contact_8dir.png
# at the time of writing). Nothing under it is authored or referenced by the app --
# the accepted output is the handful of PNGs in public/sprites/intro/, which ARE
# committed and whose sha256 the manifest pins. Left in the working tree, it is
# 95% of the bytes under the game and would be swept into any `git add -- 7_hotlineShanghai`.
7_hotlineShanghai/_gemini/
